WEBVTT

00:03:29.163 --> 00:03:31.040
Could I try listening to people

00:03:31.082 --> 00:03:34.168
the way that I was trying
to listen to music?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:37.880
Because when someone tells you something,
just like with a song,

00:03:37.922 --> 00:03:40.007
there can be all these layers within it.

00:03:40.049 --> 00:03:43.219
There can be all this context
that you're missing

00:03:43.261 --> 00:03:46.555
as the person out on the street,
outside of the house.

00:03:48.015 --> 00:03:51.811
So to get inside,
I had to listen for those moments,

00:03:51.811 --> 00:03:54.438
those clues where there was
more to be discovered,

00:03:54.438 --> 00:03:56.524
where there was
something below the surface

00:03:56.524 --> 00:03:58.359
of what was first presented to me.

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:01.779
So I borrowed from
my music-listening brain,